  "description": "The Signal Sciences site extension for Azure App Service adds next-gen Web Application Firewall (WAF)to protect any IIS web application hosted on Azure App Service. Gain the production visibility necessary to detect and block malicious web requests before they can compromise your business-critical apps, APIs and microservices. Stop web layer attacks with protection that integrates with apps written in .Net, .Net Core, Java, Node.js, Java and more.",
